SUMMARY:Vermilion River Run 10 Miler & 5 Mile
LOCATION:Picard Park\, 130 Park Ln\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:Vermilion River Run 10 Miler\nSaturday\, December 12\, 2026 | 8
 :00 AM | Picard Park\, Milton\, Louisiana\nThe Vermilion River Run is the 
 final race of the Triple Crown Challenge — and it’s strategically plac
 ed on the calendar before many spring marathons and half marathons. At 10 
 miles\, it’s the perfect distance to fit right into your training build-
 up. The event is held at the scenic Picard Park in Milton\, Louisiana.\nRa
 ce Options:\n10 Mile: Full course from start to finish\n5 Mile Option: Run
 ners turn around at 2.5 miles and follow the same route back to the finish
 \nNote: There are no cash awards for the 5 Mile option. The top 5 male and
  top 5 female finishers will receive an award.\nTriple Crown Registration 
 & Swag Eligibility:\nRegister for all three Triple Crown races together to
  qualify for exclusive Cajun Road Runners swag!\nIf you initially register
 ed for races individually and would like to switch to the Triple Crown pac
 kage\, please notify us by October 24\, 2026 to guarantee your swag. Tripl
 e Crown registrations made after October 24th may not include swag.\nPrici
 ng:\nThrough July 14: $55\nJuly 15 – October 14: $60\nOctober 15 – Dec
 ember 10: $65\nPacket Pick-Up & Race Day: $70\nOnline registration closes 
 December 12\, 2026 at 7:00 AM. Race day registration is available\, but sh
 irt sizes are limited and not guaranteed.\nRegister by November 12\, 2026 
 to be guaranteed a shirt in your size. There will be no reorders or reprin
 ts.\nCRRC Club members save an additional $5. Not valid for the virtual op
 tion.\nPacket Pick-Up:\nFriday\, December 11\, 2026: Adopted Dog Brewing f
 rom 12:30 PM - 5:30 PM\nRace Morning: Picard Park\, 6:30 AM – 7:30 AM\nW
 e strongly encourage you to pick up your packet on Friday so race morning 
 runs smoothly for everyone. We do not mail swag you must pick it up in per
 son.\nAwards 10 Miler:\nTop 3 Overall Male & Female: Cash prize\nTop 3 in 
 Each Age Group: Award\nAge groups: 12 & Under\, 13–19\, 20–29\, 30–3
 9\, 40–49\, 50–59\, 60+. Additional groups added in 10-year increments
  as needed.\n5 Mile Option: Top 5 Male & Top 5 Female: Award (no cash priz
 es)\nRace Day Parking:\nLimited parking is available at Picard Park\, 130 
 Park Lane\, Milton\, LA. For runner safety\, you will not be able to exit 
 the parking lot until the road has reopened. Please plan accordingly.\n\nh
